{
  "about": "Static collider proxies for the City kit, written by create_city_kit.py index from each piece's simple shapes. Same form as the other families' colliders.json (model coordinates, Bevy axes, Y up, metres; AvianCollider(ColliderConstructor) on a child entity at `translation`, no RigidBody). Two additions, not yet read by any code: `tilt_about_x_radians` (stairs and ramps collide as a tilted slab, rotate the child about its local X) and `walkable` (a surface the player should stand on; the controller does not support standing on colliders yet).",
